msgid "Andaman breakout"
msgstr "安达曼突围"

msgid "Andaman breakout. Text briefing. Sink the channel boats and the second wave, then land an amphibious unit on the far shore. A mine line in the channel damages ships. The far shore opens, and a squall crosses. The side cache is optional."
