msgid "Left click selects. Right click moves. F ability."
msgstr "左键选择。右键移动。F 技能。"

msgid ""
"Left-click a unit, or drag a box around your company. An orange ring shows a selected unit's weapon range, and the same ring appears while the pointer rests on a unit.\n"
"Right-click open ground to move. Right-click an enemy to attack. A ring marks that spot, then fades.\n"
"Press Q to attack-move toward the cursor. Press X to halt. Ctrl and 1 through 9 stores a group. Press the number to recall it, and press it again to center the camera.\n"
"Shift-click adds a unit. Ctrl-click toggles it. Double-click, or E, selects every unit of that type. Z lines the company up for the next move. Shift-right-click on open ground adds another step. R plants the rally flag, and new units appear beside it. The top bar shows credits gained per second.\n"
"A diamond sits on the lead unit's next step. A thin pulse marks the current objective, and the minimap frames that spot. Hits show a floating number.\n"
"Click the minimap to jump the camera there.\n"
"Press F, or Ability, to use the selected unit's power. Smart-cast fires only the closest ready unit.\n"
"The column on the right trains units and raises buildings. Walk onto a colored pad to claim it.\n"
"Boats cross deep water. Tanks and infantry stay on land, and they use a shallow ford when one is open.\n"
"Monsoon mud slows tanks and infantry. Strait Haze shortens sight unless a hydro radar is yours. On the Mekong, right-click a bridge to bring it down and open the canal. A captured arms bazaar sells CH-4, Su-30, Orlan-10, and the FLH7 Squad, and skims the enemy purse.\n"
"Low power stops new production until a plant covers the draw, and it silences defenses. Cancel drops the building in progress. A hydro radar lights the river corridor. Right-click a Slag Pillbox or Multigunner with infantry to garrison them, then click that finished building to unload. A second click on a finished Defender-VX swaps its ground and air guns.\n"
"P opens protocols. H opens this guide.\n"
"The status line reads Objective complete when you win, and Objective failed if your company dies."
msgstr ""
"左键单击单位，或拖框选中你的连队。橙色圆环显示所选单位的武器射程，指针停在单位上时也会出现同样的圆环。\n"
"右键单击空地移动。右键单击敌人攻击。圆环标记该位置，随后淡出。\n"
"按 Q 向光标处攻击移动。按 X 停止。Ctrl 加 1 至 9 保存编队。按数字调出编队，再按一次将镜头居中。\n"
"Shift 单击添加单位。Ctrl 单击切换选中。双击或按 E 选中同类全部单位。Z 让连队为下次移动列队。Shift 右键单击空地添加下一步路径点。R 放置集结旗，新单位会在旗旁出现。顶栏显示每秒获得的资金。\n"
"菱形标记领头单位的下一步。细脉冲标记当前目标，小地图会框出该位置。命中时显示浮动数字。\n"
"单击小地图可将镜头跳转到该处。\n"
"按 F 或技能键使用所选单位的技能。智能施放只让最近的就绪单位开火。\n"
"右侧栏用于训练单位和建造建筑。走上彩色资源台即可占领。\n"
"船只可穿越深水。坦克和步兵只能在陆地行动，浅滩开放时可涉水通过。\n"
"季风泥泞减慢坦克和步兵。海峡迷雾缩短视野，除非你拥有水文雷达。在湄公河上，右键单击桥梁可将其炸毁并打通运河。占领的军火集市出售 CH-4、Su-30、Orlan-10 和 FLH7 小队，并抽取敌方资金。\n"
"电力不足时新生产会停止，直到电厂满足用电需求，防御设施也会停火。取消会撤销正在建造的建筑。水文雷达照亮河道走廊。用步兵右键单击熔渣碉堡或多管炮塔即可驻守，然后单击该建成建筑卸载。再次单击已建成的守卫者-VX 可切换对地和对空武器。\n"
"P 打开协议。H 打开本指南。\n"
"获胜时状态栏显示“目标完成”，连队覆灭则显示“目标失败”。"

msgid "Left-click select. Shift-click adds. Double-click or E selects that type. Right-click ground to move, an enemy to attack. Shift-right-click adds a waypoint. Z lines the company up. Q attack-move. X halt. R moves the rally flag. Ctrl+1-9 stores a group, the number recalls it. A ring marks the order. Click the minimap to jump. F ability. H guide. P opens protocols."
msgstr "左键单击选择。Shift 单击添加。双击或按 E 选中同类。右键单击地面移动，单击敌人攻击。Shift 右键单击添加路径点。Z 让连队列队。Q 攻击移动。X 停止。R 移动集结旗。Ctrl+1-9 保存编队，按数字调出。圆环标记命令位置。单击小地图跳转。F 技能。H 指南。P 打开协议。"

